### Cake Platform API - Shop Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/shops
@authUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/auth

### =========================================
### 0. Authenticate to get Token
### =========================================
# @name loginUser
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "owner@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store the token from the login response
@token = {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}

### =========================================
### 1. Shop Profile Tests
### =========================================

### 2. View My Shop Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-shop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. View Owner Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-shop/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1b. Update My Shop Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/my-shop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "businessName": "John's Premium Cakes",
    "description": "The best custom cakes in town! We specialize in wedding and birthday cakes.",
    "phone": "+1999888777",
    "address": "123 Baker Street",
    "city": "London",
    "state": "Greater London",
    "pincode": "NW1 6XE",
    "businessCategory": "Bakery",
    "logoUrl": "https://example.com/logo.png",
    "coverImageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509440159596-0249088772ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
}

### 1c. Update with Invalid Data (Validation Error)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/my-shop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "businessName": "A",
    "phone": "This phone number is way too long to be valid for the database limit of 15 characters"
}

### 1d. Unauthenticated Access (Should fail with 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/my-shop

### =========================================
### Create Delivery Slot
### =========================================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/owner/delivery-slots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "dayOfWeek": "EVERYDAY",
    "startTime": "10:00:00",
    "endTime": "14:00:00",
    "maxOrders": 20
}